CHEN_P5_AUDIT_DECL {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"ImbalancedChen.CurrentChenMeanLedger","name":"ImbalancedChen.chenY6Selected_add_compl","type":"∀ (n : ℕ) (A H D : ℝ) (E : ℕ × ℕ → Prop),\n  (ImbalancedChen.chenY6Selected n A H D E + ImbalancedChen.chenY6Selected n A H D fun t => ¬E t) =\n    ImbalancedChen.chenY6 n A H D"}
